function to turn the robot

this function should be only called from within the scanning function.

## function description ##
	
	1) parameter of this function is the laserBeamPos

	2) this function should be able to call another function that would check distances for objects on both sides of the robot while giving feedback and not execute any other functions.
	
	
####

void turn (int laserBeamPos){

	msg.linear.x = 0.35		# slow down robot first
	
	## check right and left 
	
	check(right); 		# return the distance from objects (lowest number in range of laserBeam data)
	check(left);		# same
	
	if (right > left){
		msg.angular.z = 1.5;
		publish the message here and exit this funtion.
	}else if (right < left){
		msg.angular.z = -1.5;
		publish the message and exit this function.
	}
	
